<title>USA: NYSE closing averages.</title>
<headline>NYSE closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the New York Stock Exchange closed lower in very light trading Friday.</p>
<p>The Dow Jones Industrial Average fell 31.44 to 5616.21.</p>
<p>For the week, it lost 106.53.</p>
<p>The NYSE composite fell 2.37 to 350.99.</p>
<p>The average price per share fell $0.26.</p>
<p>Losers beat gainers 1469 to 802.</p>
<p>Volume was 256,946,170, compared with 321,092,760 Thursday.</p>
